#. module: eyewear_shop
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:eyewear_shop.appointment_type_1
msgid ""
"✔ <strong>Comfortable &amp; Professional Experience</strong> – Our friendly "
"team is here to make your visit smooth and stress-free."
msgstr ""
"✔ <strong>ປະສົບການທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ ແລະ ເປັນມືອາຊີບ</strong> – ທີມງານທີ່ເປັນກັນເອງຂອງພວກເຮົາພ້"
"ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການເພື່ອໃຫ້ການມາຢ້ຽມຢາມຂອງທ່ານສະດວກ ແລະ ຜ່ອນຄາຍ."

#. module: eyewear_shop
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:eyewear_shop.appointment_type_1
msgid ""
"✔ <strong>Comprehensive Eye Exams</strong> – Assess your vision and overall "
"eye health with advanced testing."
msgstr ""
"✔ <strong>ການກວດສຸຂະພາບຕາຢ່າງລະອຽດ</strong> – ປະເມີນຄ່າສາຍຕາ ແລະ ສຸຂະພາບຕາໂດຍລວມ ດ້"
"ວຍການກວດລະດັບສູງ."

#. module: eyewear_shop
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:eyewear_shop.appointment_type_1
msgid ""
"✔ <strong>Personalized Vision Care</strong> – Get expert recommendations for "
"glasses, contact lenses, or treatments based on your unique needs."
msgstr ""
"✔ <strong>ການດູແລສາຍຕາສະເພາະບຸກຄົນ</strong> – ຮັບຄຳແນະນຳຈາກຊ່ຽວຊານສຳລັບແວ່ນຕາ, ຄອນແທັ"
"ກເລນສ໌ ຫຼື ການປິ່ນປົວ ຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການສະເພາະຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: eyewear_shop
#: model_terms:appointment.type,message_intro:eyewear_shop.appointment_type_1
msgid ""
"✔ <strong>State-of-the-Art Technology</strong> – We use the latest "
"diagnostic equipment to ensure accurate results."
msgstr ""
"✔ <strong>ເຕັກໂນໂລຊີທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ</strong> – ພວກເຮົາໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນກວດວິເຄາະລ່າສຸດ ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນຜົນກວ"
"ດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ຊັດເຈນ."

